Each sale is priced against adverse selection. Informed buyers only take the ask when card 3 is high, and noise buyers are more likely to take a low ask. My rough calculation puts the expected loss per unit sold at about -4.6 for an ask of 18, -4.7 for 19, and worse at 16 or 22. The loss is least around 18 to 19, so I'll post an ask of 18.5.

