I checked expected edge at candidate prices against the 65/35 noise/informed mix. Both sides peak around 4–5 for the bid and 17–18 for the ask. Recent history (bids at 5 and 9 were hit by sellers) hints that die 2 may be low, which lowers the fair value. So I'm pulling the ask a bit lower to 15.5 to stay competitive, and keeping the bid at 4 since I'm already long 2 and can add one more unit at a low price.

