I'm long 3 and can only sell, so I'm choosing the ask. An informed buyer only buys when settlement exceeds my ask, and settlement never exceeds 4, so asks above 4 face no informed flow. Above 4, the expected gain per quote is roughly 0.8 × P(noise valuation > ask) × (ask − 3.65). That peaks near an ask of 5.4, where it's about 0.31 per unit. Below 4, adverse selection from informed buyers makes the trade unprofitable.

