I'm long 3 and only the ask is allowed, so I want to sell at a price that maximizes the chance of a trade times the margin over 3.65. Noise traders value the contract around 3.65 with standard deviation 2.3. Informed traders only buy when the settlement exceeds my ask, which can't happen for asks at or above 4, so there's no adverse selection at higher asks. Maximizing P(valuation > ask) × (ask − 3.65) gives an ask near 5.37, which rounds up to 5.4.

